///
/// This method is the inverse of **`registerProtocolHandler()`**.␀␀␀À±òÀ±òDÀ²(%/// This method always returns false.␀À#À#À␀n:ÀÑ/// The **`Navigator`** interface represents the state and the identity of the
/// user agent. It allows scripts to query it and to register themselves to
/// carry on some activities.
///
/// A `Navigator` object can be retrieved using the read-only [window.navigator]
/// property.
///
/// ---
